<title>ZAMBIA: Zambia September consumer prices up 45.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zambia September consumer prices up 45.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia's all-items consumer price index rose by 1.4 percent in September from August, bringing the year-on-year increase to 45.6 percent, the central bank said.</p>
<p>				Sep 1996	  Aug 1996	  Sep 1995</p>
<p>Yr-on-yr pct change     45.6		49.3		34.2</p>
<p>All-items index	   202.2	     199.4	     138.9</p>
<p>Note: Index 1985 = 100</p>
<p>-- Lusaka newsroom  260-1-222689</p>
